    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "No.5 Torcaill is a beautiful 4 bedroom detached family home ideally nestled in a quiet cul de sac of this family friendly estate. Built in 2003 by Bovale this fully red brick property boasts well-proportioned accommodation throughout, large front driveway and a west facing rear garden which soaks up the sun all day long.\r\n\r\nThe property briefly consists of a large entrance hall with guest wc, spacious lounge with gas fire inset, a beautifully open plan kitchen / dining and a family room with log burning stove, utility room and patio doors out to a west facing rear garden. On the first floor there are 4 spacious bedrooms, master bedroom ensuite and family bathroom. The rear garden is patio with a large roof covered side passage which provides ample dry storage or workshop space.\r\n\r\nTorcaill is close to a whole host of local amenities including stunning scenic walks into Malahide, National & Primary Schools, Sports & Leisure Centre, both local soccer & GAA facilities and Dunnes Stores all right on your doorstep…"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Hall\t            5.09 x 1.8\t    Decorative timber flooring, alarm, recessed lighting\r\n\r\nGuest W.C\t\t           Tiled floor & walls, w.c, w.h.b, mirror, \r\n \r\nLounge\t    5.29 x 3.86\t   Decorative timber flooring, recessed lighting, gas fireplace, bright bay window \r\n\t\t\r\nOpen Plan Kitchen / Dining & Family Area    5.83 x 7.08       Decorative timber flooring, recessed lighting, built in log burning stove, fully fitted kitchen, double oven, microwave, fridge freezer, dishwasher, large sliding door to rear garden, two large Velux windows\r\n\r\nUtility            \t                       Plumbed for washing machine and dryer, door to garden, tiled flooring, fitted shelves \r\n\t\t\r\nStairs/Landing\t\t               Hot press, access to attic, carpeted \r\n\t\t\r\nBedroom 1\t2.8 x 2.3  \tDecorative timber floor, fitted wardrobe, curtains \r\n\t\t\r\nBedroom 2\t2.5 x 2.83\tDecorative timber floor, fitted wardrobe, recessed lights, blinds\r\n\t\t\r\nEn-suite\t       1.52 x 1.87\tTiled floor & walls, large mirror, w.c, w.h.b, standalone shower, heated rail \r\n\t\t\r\nBedroom 3\t2.86 x 3.83\tDecorative timber floor, fitted wardrobes, recessed lighting, curtains  \r\n\t\t\r\nBedroom 4\t3.21 x 3.81\tDecorative timber floor, abundant fitted wardrobes, blinds, curtains recessed lighting \r\n\t\t\r\nGarden\tTimber decking, patio, large flower bed, two side passages, lean to for workshop/storage."
